#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000000
msgid ""
"Professor Gálvez comes from \n"
"Costa Rica's University for Peace."
msgstr ""
"加尔维斯教授来自\n"
"哥斯达黎加和平大学。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000001
msgid "You see, over the past year,"
msgstr "你看，过去一年里，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000002
msgid ""
"there have been sightings of \n"
"an armed group in Costa Rica."
msgstr ""
"哥斯达黎加有人目击到\n"
"一支武装团体。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000003
msgid "They're not ours, of course."
msgstr "他们当然不是我们的人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000004
msgid "Costa Rica doesn't have an army."
msgstr "哥斯达黎加没有军队。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000005
msgid "Correct."
msgstr "对。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000006
msgid "Article 12 of our constitution states that"
msgstr "我国宪法第12条规定"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000007
msgid ""
"\"the Army as a permanent institution\n"
"is abolished.\""
msgstr ""
"\"军队作为常设机构\n"
"已被废除。\""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e16/0x000008
msgid "The peace constitution..."
msgstr "和平宪法……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e9d/0x000000
msgid ""
"My name is Paz, and I will do anything\n"
"to protect my namesake. "
msgstr ""
"我叫Paz，我会不惜一切\n"
"保护我的同名者。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e9d/0x000001
msgid "It is my one and only purpose."
msgstr "这是我唯一的目的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e9d/0x000002
msgid ""
"Please... get them out of my country... \n"
"Make them leave Costa Rica. "
msgstr ""
"求你了……让他们离开我的国家……\n"
"让他们离开哥斯达黎加。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e9d/0x000003
msgid "Sorry, kid... "
msgstr "抱歉，孩子……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x225e9d/0x000004
msgid ""
"We know who you are, Big Boss.\n"
"That is why we've come to you."
msgstr ""
"我们知道你是谁，Big Boss。\n"
"这就是我们来找你的原因。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325df5/0x000000
msgid "Here."
msgstr "拿着。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325df5/0x000001
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005c
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "谢谢。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000000
msgid "Lies, obviously."
msgstr "显然是谎言。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000001
msgid ""
"They're bringing in state-of-the-art \n"
"weaponry and equipment by the shipload."
msgstr ""
"他们正用船运来最先进的\n"
"武器和装备。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000002
msgid "Where'd they get that kind of cash?"
msgstr "他们哪来那么多钱？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000003
msgid "...I fear la CIA may be involved."
msgstr "……我担心CIA有份。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000004
msgid "The CIA?"
msgstr "CIA？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000005
msgid ""
"As you both know, the United States views\n"
"Central America as its backyard..."
msgstr ""
"你们都知道，美国把\n"
"中美洲视为自家后院……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000006
msgid ""
"Even after Cuba, we've managed to\n"
"maintain a delicate balance with the U.S."
msgstr ""
"即使在古巴之后，我们仍设法\n"
"与美国维持着微妙的平衡。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000007
msgid ""
"And your government\n"
"can't just give 'em the boot?"
msgstr ""
"而你们的政府\n"
"就不能直接把他们赶走吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000008
msgid "We are not allowed to bear arms."
msgstr "我们不许持武器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x000009
msgid ""
"Japan's constitution has something \n"
"similar... Article 9."
msgstr ""
"日本宪法也有\n"
"类似的内容……第九条。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x00000a
msgid ""
"It says Japan renounces war,\n"
"and can't maintain an army."
msgstr ""
"它规定日本放弃战争，\n"
"不能维持军队。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x00000b
msgid ""
"I understand that you and your men have\n"
"neither state nor ideology."
msgstr ""
"我明白你和你的手下\n"
"既无国家也无意识形态。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x00000c
msgid "...That you will fight any foe."
msgstr "……你们会与任何敌人作战。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x00000d
msgid ""
"Please, you must drive them out of \n"
"our defenseless country."
msgstr ""
"求求你，把他们赶出我们\n"
"这个毫无防备的国家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x325e54/0x00000e
msgid ""
"We come to you, \n"
"the Militaires San Frontières."
msgstr ""
"我们来找你们，\n"
"边境无国界军。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000000
msgid "So, you want to hire us?"
msgstr "你们想雇我们？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000001
msgid "Yes. As our deterrent."
msgstr "是的。作为我们的威慑力量。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000002
msgid "...We can't afford to pay much, it's true."
msgstr "……我们确实付不起多少钱。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000003
msgid "But,"
msgstr "但是，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000004
msgid ""
"we can offer you this, \n"
"a forward operating base."
msgstr ""
"我们可以给你这个，\n"
"一座前进作战基地。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000005
msgid "... an offshore plant in the Caribbean."
msgstr "……加勒比的一座海上工厂。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000006
msgid "Sounds pretty good to me."
msgstr "听起来挺不错。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000007
msgid "This place is becoming a mess anyway."
msgstr "反正这地方越来越乱了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000008
msgid ""
"Snake, we need someplace \n"
"we can settle down. "
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，我们需要个\n"
"能安顿的地方。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000009
msgid ""
"The government's agreed to cooperate \n"
"... unofficially, of course."
msgstr ""
"政府已同意合作\n"
"……当然，是非官方的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00000a
msgid "A chopper for transport'd be nice, too. "
msgstr "再来架运输直升机就更好了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00000b
msgid "...I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "……我尽量想办法。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00000d
msgid ""
"You seem to think we're just a pack \n"
"of \"dogs of war.\" Is that right? "
msgstr ""
"你似乎觉得我们只是一群\n"
"“战争野狗”。是吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00000e
msgid ""
"Yes, that's what I've heard. \n"
"You're an army without a state... "
msgstr ""
"是的，我听说了。\n"
"你们是无国之军……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00000f
msgid "No... We've only left our countries behind."
msgstr "不……我们只是离开了祖国。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000010
msgid "Please! You must help us!"
msgstr "求求你！你一定要帮我们！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000011
msgid ""
"If your suspicions are true,\n"
"force isn't gonna do any good."
msgstr ""
"若你的怀疑属实，\n"
"武力解决不了问题。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000012
msgid "You'll have to find a political solution."
msgstr "你得寻求政治解决。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000013
msgid "The government's hands are tied!"
msgstr "政府已经束手无策了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000014
msgid "Go back to your bosses in San José."
msgstr "回去找圣何塞的上司吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000015
msgid ""
"Tell them if they want, \n"
"I'll introduce them to a negotiator I know."
msgstr ""
"告诉他们，愿意的话，\n"
"我介绍个认识的谈判专家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000016
msgid "No,"
msgstr "不，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000017
msgid "I'm not here on their behalf."
msgstr "我不是代表他们来的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000018
msgid "So what are you doing here?"
msgstr "那你来这做什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x000019
msgid ""
"For over twenty years, I've preached \n"
"the virtues of peace at multiple universities."
msgstr ""
"二十多年来，我在多所大学\n"
"宣讲和平之道。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x4bcf29/0x00001a
msgid ""
"Tonight, I stand before \n"
"you as an educator. "
msgstr ""
"今晚，我以教育者的身份\n"
"站在各位面前。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000000
msgid ""
"They've got a supply port north of Puerto\n"
"Limon, a town en la costa del mar Caribe."
msgstr ""
"他们在利蒙港以北有一处补给港，\n"
"那是加勒比海沿岸的一座小镇。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000001
msgid ""
"A few days ago, Paz stumbled upon that \n"
"facility while searching for a lost friend. "
msgstr ""
"几天前，帕兹为了寻找失踪的朋友，\n"
"偶然撞见了那处设施。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000002
msgid "She was captured."
msgstr "她被抓了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000003
msgid "She's only a child... sixteen years old. "
msgstr "她只是个孩子……才十六岁。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000004
msgid ""
"They did... terrible things to her. \n"
"But somehow she managed to escape. "
msgstr ""
"他们对她……做了很可怕的事。\n"
"可她还是想办法逃了出来。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000005
msgid "My God..."
msgstr "我的天……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000006
msgid ""
"She's huerfana. \n"
"Her mother died when she was small,"
msgstr ""
"她是个孤儿。\n"
"母亲在她很小的时候就去世了，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000007
msgid ""
"and she lost her grandparents \n"
"in the civil war."
msgstr ""
"祖父母也\n"
"在内战中离开了她。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x625e80/0x000008
msgid "She hates war with a passion like no other. "
msgstr "她对战争的憎恨，比任何人都强烈。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000000
msgid ""
"This is my student.\n"
"She came to me to study peace. "
msgstr ""
"这是我的学生。\n"
"她来我这里学习和平。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000001
msgid "Her name is Paz. Paz Ortega."
msgstr "她叫帕兹。帕兹·奥特加。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000002
msgid "Paz...? \"Peace?\""
msgstr "帕兹……？“和平”吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000003
msgid "No kidding? That's my name, too."
msgstr "不开玩笑？我的名字也是这个意思。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000004
msgid "Kazuhira... it's Japanese for \"peace.\" "
msgstr "Kazuhira……在日语里就是“和平”的意思。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x7a8b99/0x000005
msgid "Pleased to meet you, Paz. Call me Kaz. "
msgstr "很高兴认识你，帕兹。叫我卡兹就好。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x825e31/0x000000
msgid ""
"You think it's rebels\n"
"who've fled Nicaragua?"
msgstr ""
"你以为这些是从尼加拉瓜\n"
"逃出的叛军？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x825e31/0x000001
msgid ""
"No no...They don't appear to be guerillas. \n"
"They're far too organized."
msgstr ""
"不不……他们不像是游击队。\n"
"组织性太强了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x825e31/0x000002
msgid "What's your government's take?"
msgstr "你们政府怎么看？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x825e31/0x000003
msgid ""
"The authorities in San José claim \n"
"it's a multinational security firm"
msgstr ""
"圣何塞当局声称\n"
"这是一家跨国安保公司"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x825e31/0x000004
msgid ""
"hired by the Development Corporation \n"
"of Costa Rica."
msgstr ""
"受雇于哥斯达黎加\n"
"开发公司。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x925df8/0x000000
msgid ""
"I feel like a new man!\n"
"There's no coffee like Costa Rican coffee."
msgstr ""
"我感觉焕然一新！\n"
"哥斯达黎加咖啡无与伦比。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x925df8/0x000001
msgid ""
"So, what brings a distinguished scholar from\n"
"the Costa Rican government to Colombia?"
msgstr ""
"那么，是什么让哥斯达黎加政府的\n"
"杰出学者来到哥伦比亚？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000000
msgid "What's going on, Kaz?"
msgstr "怎么了，卡兹？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000001
msgid "We've got guests."
msgstr "有客人来。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000002
msgid "Time to move?"
msgstr "该走了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000003
msgid ""
"Don't worry.\n"
"It's not our friends from Langley."
msgstr ""
"别担心。\n"
"不是兰利那帮朋友。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000004
msgid ""
"I brought 'em.\n"
"Made sure we weren't followed."
msgstr ""
"是我带他们来。\n"
"确认没被跟踪。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000005
msgid "Thank you, Big Boss!"
msgstr "谢谢你，BIG BOSS！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000006
msgid "Call me Snake."
msgstr "叫我SNAKE。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000007
msgid "Oh, uh, sorry... Vic Boss!"
msgstr "哦，呃，抱歉……Vic Boss！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000008
msgid "Listen up. For us, there is no victory."
msgstr "听着。我们赢不了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x000009
msgid "But in revolution, doesn't one triumph or die?"
msgstr "但革命中，不成功便成仁吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af52d/0x98765e/0x00000a
msgid "We don't do either."
msgstr "我们也不做。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000000
msgid "Are they still here?"
msgstr "他们还在这？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000001
msgid "C'mon, Snake. This could be good for us."
msgstr "来吧，SNAKE。这对我们有利。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000002
msgid "They're willing to give us an offshore plant "
msgstr "他们愿意给我们一座海上工厂，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000003
msgid ""
"a place we can finally put down some roots. \n"
"This is our chance to expand MSF."
msgstr ""
"一个终于能扎根的地方。\n"
"这是我们扩张MSF的机会。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000004
msgid "We don't need a place to stay, Kaz. "
msgstr "我们不需要落脚点，卡兹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000005
msgid "We're nomads, we always will be."
msgstr "我们是游牧者，永远都是。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000006
msgid ""
"What, you'd rather keep wandering \n"
"from conflict to conflict,"
msgstr ""
"怎么，你宁愿游走于\n"
"一场场冲突间，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000007
msgid ""
"tools in the hands of whoever's \n"
"fighting at the time?"
msgstr ""
"充当当时开战者的\n"
"手中工具？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000008
msgid ""
"The second we settle down, who's to say\n"
"we won't become the warmongers?"
msgstr ""
"我们一旦安顿下来，谁敢说\n"
"我们不会变成好战者？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000009
msgid ""
"Listen to me, Snake. We're not mercenaries.\n"
"We're not a foreign legion. "
msgstr ""
"听我说，SNAKE。我们不是雇佣兵。\n"
"我们不是外籍军团。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000a
msgid "MSF's a business. A new kind of business."
msgstr "MSF是门生意。一种新型生意。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000b
msgid "Look, it's not like we're trying to start a war here. "
msgstr "听着，我们又不是想在这里挑起战争。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000c
msgid ""
"All we need to do is find out who this\n"
"\"security company\" really is."
msgstr ""
"我们要做的只是查清这家\n"
"“保安公司”到底是谁。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000d
msgid ""
"C'mon, Kaz... It's pretty obvious that \n"
"they're backed by the CIA."
msgstr ""
"得了吧，卡兹……很明显\n"
"他们背后是CIA。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000e
msgid "Wait a sec. That would mean..."
msgstr "等等。那岂不是说……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00000f
msgid "Our friend the \"professor\"... is likely KGB."
msgstr "我们那位“教授”朋友……很可能属于克格勃。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000010
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000058
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "原来如此……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000011
msgid "...We'd be making an enemy of our homeland."
msgstr "……我们就将与祖国为敌。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000012
msgid "And there'd be no turning back..."
msgstr "而且再无回头路……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000013
msgid "...This damned thing won't light."
msgstr "……这鬼东西点不着。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000014
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000038
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000004
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00006b
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "嗯？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000015
msgid ""
"Put on some coffee, Kaz.\n"
"It's time for a little chat with the \"professor.\""
msgstr ""
"煮点咖啡，卡兹。\n"
"该跟“教授”聊聊了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000016
msgid "I was a heavy smoker. "
msgstr "我以前烟瘾很重。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000017
msgid "When I got my medal from the Secretary General, "
msgstr "当秘书长给我颁发勋章时，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000018
msgid "he gave me this prosthetic hand as well..."
msgstr "他也给了我这只假手……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000019
msgid ""
"But smoking was ruining my lungs, so I quit.\n"
"I've not had much use for it since."
msgstr ""
"但抽烟毁了我的肺，所以我戒了。\n"
"从那以后就很少用上它。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001a
msgid ""
"It's quite an honor to meet \n"
"the legendary Big Boss."
msgstr ""
"能见到传奇BIG BOSS，\n"
"真是荣幸。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001b
msgid "That's just a code name the CIA made up."
msgstr "那只是CIA编出来的代号。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001c
msgid "Then perhaps I should call you John?"
msgstr "那么也许我该叫你约翰？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001d
msgid "I don't have a name. "
msgstr "我没有名字。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001e
msgid ""
"Stopped using that code name you \n"
"like so much ten years ago."
msgstr ""
"十年前就不再使用你\n"
"喜欢的那个代号了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00001f
msgid ""
"...What about you, comrade?\n"
"What do they call you back at Tsentr?"
msgstr ""
"……你呢，同志？\n"
"在中央局他们怎么称呼你？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000020
msgid "Well, then, allow me to get straight to the point."
msgstr "那么，我就直入正题了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000021
msgid "\"Land as slim as a whip, hot as torture.\""
msgstr "“土地细如鞭，酷热如刑。”"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000022
msgid "That's the Chilean poet, Neruda... "
msgstr "智利诗人聂鲁达……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000023
msgid ""
"Central America is the navel\n"
"of the American continents, "
msgstr ""
"中美洲是美洲大陆的\n"
"肚脐，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000024
msgid "bridging North and South."
msgstr "连接着南北两方。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000025
msgid "We want this land."
msgstr "我们想要这片土地。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000026
msgid ""
"We'll build a socialist stronghold, \n"
"then use it to split the Americas in two."
msgstr ""
"我们要建立社会主义据点，\n"
"再借此把美洲一分为二。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000027
msgid "America would lose its backyard."
msgstr "美国将失去它的后院。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000028
msgid ""
"And with it, its economic production, \n"
"shipping lanes, and strategic value."
msgstr ""
"随之失去的还有经济生产、\n"
"航运要道和战略价值。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000029
msgid "We, on the other hand, "
msgstr "而我们，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002a
msgid ""
"would gain a base from which all of Latin America\n"
"would be well within our reach."
msgstr ""
"将获得一个基地，整个拉丁美洲\n"
"都将尽在我们掌握之中。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002b
msgid ""
"He who controls Central America,\n"
"will win this Cold War."
msgstr ""
"谁控制了中美洲，\n"
"谁就能赢得这场冷战。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002c
msgid "First comes Nicaragua."
msgstr "先到尼加拉瓜。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002d
msgid "Toppling the pro-American Somoza regime."
msgstr "推翻亲美的索摩查政权。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002e
msgid ""
"In preparation, we've begun instigating\n"
"anti-Somoza sentiment "
msgstr ""
"为此，我们已开始煽动\n"
"反索摩查情绪，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00002f
msgid ""
"and providing aid to the Sandinista \n"
"National Liberation Front."
msgstr ""
"并向桑地诺\n"
"民族解放阵线提供援助。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000030
msgid ""
"You're manipulating Sandinista into\n"
"overthrowing Somoza for you."
msgstr ""
"你在操纵桑地诺派替你\n"
"推翻索摩查。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000031
msgid ""
"After the revolution, \n"
"Nicaragua will become a socialist state."
msgstr ""
"革命之后，\n"
"尼加拉瓜将成为社会主义国家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000032
msgid "You think America's just gonna let that happen?"
msgstr "你觉得美国会坐视不管吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000033
msgid "Certainly not. After all, the CIA is already here."
msgstr "当然不会。毕竟，CIA已经在这里了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000034
msgid "And that's the armed group inside Costa Rica?"
msgstr "就是哥斯达黎加境内的那支武装？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000035
msgid ""
"Precisely. It's clear they've been sent in to \n"
"disrupt our efforts across the border,"
msgstr ""
"正是。显然他们是被派来\n"
"破坏我们跨境行动的，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000036
msgid "in Nicaragua."
msgstr "在尼加拉瓜。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000037
msgid ""
"Simply put, the army now stationed in \n"
"Costa Rica is CIA capital."
msgstr ""
"简单说，驻\n"
"哥斯达黎加军队就是CIA资金。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000038
msgid ""
"But it's more complex than that.\n"
"The CIA's got something else planned as well."
msgstr ""
"但事情没那么简单。\n"
"CIA还另有打算。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000039
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000097
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003b
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x16da5b/0x000000
#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00000c
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000038
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000049
msgid "What?"
msgstr "什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003a
msgid "That is the million dollar question."
msgstr "这正是关键所在。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003b
msgid ""
"Big Boss, we want you \n"
"and your unit to find the answer."
msgstr ""
"BIG BOSS，希望你\n"
"和部队找出答案。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003c
msgid ""
"Infiltrate and investigate the facility en la costa\n"
"where Paz was imprisoned. "
msgstr ""
"潜入并调查帕兹曾被关押的\n"
"海边设施。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003d
msgid ""
"Learn all you can of their operations.\n"
"Then, drive them out of the country."
msgstr ""
"尽可能摸清他们的行动。\n"
"然后把他们赶出这个国家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003e
msgid ""
"You're asking us to settle a turf war\n"
"between the KGB and the CIA?"
msgstr ""
"你是要我们插手\n"
"克格勃和CIA的地盘之争？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00003f
msgid "...What about her? That was all just an act?"
msgstr "……那她呢？那些都只是演戏？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000040
msgid "Hmm. You mean her words about peace?"
msgstr "嗯。你是说她那些关于和平的话？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000041
msgid ""
"She was captured - that much is true.\n"
"But I've kept my KGB affiliation from her."
msgstr ""
"她被俘了，这点真。\n"
"但我没让她知道我是克格勃。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000042
msgid "And you thought we'd fall for a sob story?"
msgstr "你以为我们会信这种苦情戏？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000043
msgid "No, I had good reason to bring her along."
msgstr "不，我带她来有充分理由。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000044
msgid ""
"She managed to escape with her life.\n"
"But her friend was not so lucky."
msgstr ""
"她侥幸活了下来。\n"
"但她的朋友就没那么幸运了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000045
msgid ""
"Why were they attacked? \n"
"I believe this will help explain."
msgstr ""
"她们为何遭到袭击？\n"
"我想这能解释清楚。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000046
msgid ""
"Perhaps they saw something \n"
"they weren't supposed to."
msgstr ""
"也许她们看到了\n"
"不该看的东西。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000047
msgid ""
"Perhaps they heard something \n"
"they shouldn't have."
msgstr ""
"也许她们听到了\n"
"不该听的东西。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000048
msgid "A cassette tape?"
msgstr "盒式磁带？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000049
msgid "Paz took this during her escape."
msgstr "帕兹逃跑时拿的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004a
msgid ""
"She says her friend happened \n"
"to record it by accident."
msgstr ""
"她说她朋友\n"
"碰巧录下了这段。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004b
msgid "What is that?"
msgstr "那啥？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004c
msgid ""
"A portable stereo cassette player. \n"
"The first of its kind."
msgstr ""
"便携立体声磁带机。\n"
"同类首款。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004d
msgid ""
"Ah. I heard they were working \n"
"on something like that in Japan. "
msgstr ""
"啊，我听说日本\n"
"正在研发这种东西。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004e
msgid "Didn't know you guys were, too."
msgstr "没想到你们也在搞。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00004f
msgid ""
"I believe what you're about to hear \n"
"will help you understand."
msgstr ""
"我想你接下来听到的\n"
"会让你明白。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000050
msgid "What is that? A quetzal?"
msgstr "那是什么？凤尾绿咬鹃？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000051
msgid "The phoenix bird?"
msgstr "不死鸟？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000052
msgid "Paz's friend was researching birds."
msgstr "帕兹的朋友在研究鸟类。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000053
msgid ""
"She went out into the jungle to record\n"
"bird calls and stumbled upon this."
msgstr ""
"她进丛林录鸟鸣，\n"
"偶然录到了这个。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000054
msgid "So? So what?!"
msgstr "所以呢？那又怎样？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000055
msgid "Now it gets interesting."
msgstr "接下来才精彩。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000056
msgid "...poisonous... I... to get rid of it."
msgstr "……有毒……我……要除掉它。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000057
msgid "I chase it back to its nest."
msgstr "我把它追回巢穴。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000058
msgid ""
"You can't. The snake's too vicious. \n"
"It's... many people."
msgstr ""
"不行。那蛇太凶了。\n"
"它……害了很多人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000059
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000002
msgid "...I chase it away."
msgstr "……我把它赶走。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005a
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000003
msgid "It will bite you unless you kill it."
msgstr "你不杀它，它就会咬你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005b
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x227db3/0x000004
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000006
#: slot/0x003b01cd/0x629073/0x000000
msgid "Go home!"
msgstr "回家去！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005c
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000002
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000003
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000007
#: slot/0x003b022d/0x3291f1/0x000001
msgid "Boss..."
msgstr "BOSS……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005d
msgid ""
"Voiceprint analysis confirms that this voice \n"
"is indeed that of the legendary hero "
msgstr ""
"声纹分析确认，这个声音\n"
"正是传说中的英雄"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005e
msgid " - and criminal - The Boss."
msgstr "，罪犯，THE BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00005f
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000f
msgid "Wh... what?!"
msgstr "什……什么？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000060
msgid ""
"The other hasn't been identified.\n"
"Female, in her thirties, with a British accent."
msgstr ""
"另一个身份尚未查明。\n"
"女性，三十多岁，带英国口音。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000061
msgid ""
"The song playing in the background \n"
"was a hit in 1973."
msgstr ""
"背景播放的歌曲\n"
"是1973年的热门曲目。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000062
msgid ""
"What's it going to be? \n"
"Loyalty to your country or loyalty to me? "
msgstr ""
"你要怎么选？\n"
"忠于国家还是忠于我？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000063
msgid ""
"Your country or your mentor?\n"
"Your mission or your beliefs?"
msgstr ""
"国家还是导师？\n"
"任务还是信念？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000064
msgid "...Boss is alive in Costa Rica?"
msgstr "……BOSS在哥斯达黎加还活着？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000065
msgid ""
"As I understand it, she was your commander,\n"
"fought by your side..."
msgstr ""
"据我所知，她是你指挥官，\n"
"与你并肩作战……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000066
msgid ""
"And that you killed her \n"
"under orders from the CIA... "
msgstr ""
"而你奉CIA之命\n"
"杀了她……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000067
msgid ""
"Thus surpassing her to become the hero\n"
"known as Big Boss."
msgstr ""
"从而超越她，成为\n"
"被称为BIG BOSS的英雄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000068
msgid "Well? What'll it be? Will you take the job?"
msgstr "怎么样？接不接这活？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x000069
msgid "Snake, it's gotta be a trap."
msgstr "SNAKE，肯定是陷阱。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006a
msgid ""
"So, you still can't turn your back \n"
"on your country..."
msgstr ""
"所以，你还是无法背弃\n"
"你的国家……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006b
msgid "Then I suppose you won't need this... "
msgstr "那我想你不需要这个了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006c
#: slot/0x00eeea4a/0x3d5431/0xd9ea26
msgid "Wait!"
msgstr "等等！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006d
msgid "Snake?"
msgstr "SNAKE？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006e
msgid "I'll do it for the girl. For Paz."
msgstr "我接，为了那女孩。为了帕兹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af54d/0x395f10/0x00006f
msgid "OK... For peace, then."
msgstr "确定……那就为了和平。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af56d/0x325ef1/0x000000
msgid ""
"Yes, sir, we broke 'im. We've acquired\n"
"the whereabouts of target five-zero-zero."
msgstr ""
"是，长官，我们撬开了他的嘴。已掌握\n"
"目标五零零的下落。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af56d/0x525ef3/0x000000
msgid "Acknowledged. "
msgstr "收到。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af56d/0x525ef3/0x000001
msgid ""
"TJ-Chrysalis 6000, \n"
"proceeding to secure target five hundred..."
msgstr ""
"TJ-蝶蛹 6000，\n"
"前往确保目标五百……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af56d/0x525ef3/0x000002
msgid ""
"Spears are loaded. \n"
"The barge has cleared Point Bravo."
msgstr ""
"矛已装填。\n"
"驳船已通过B点。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af56d/0x525ef3/0x000003
msgid "Acknowledged. Out."
msgstr "收到。完毕。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af58d/0x625f73/0x000000
msgid "...Freeze!"
msgstr "……不许动！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af58d/0x625f73/0x000001
msgid "The cargo, where's it headed? What is it?!"
msgstr "货物要运去哪？是什么东西？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af58d/0x625f73/0x000002
msgid "Urk... Irazu... In the mountains..."
msgstr "呃…伊拉苏…在山里…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af58d/0x625f73/0x000003
msgid "What's up there?"
msgstr "上面有啥？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x226012/0x000000
msgid ""
"The cargo's heading from the marshes\n"
"west toward Irazú."
msgstr ""
"货物正从沼泽地\n"
"往西运向伊拉苏。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x226012/0x000001
msgid "Nice going, Boss."
msgstr "干得好，BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x226012/0x000002
msgid ""
"Kaz... this place is full of film badges.\n"
"Dozens of them."
msgstr ""
"卡兹…这地全是胶片佩章。\n"
"几十个。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x226012/0x000003
msgid ""
"...Film badges? Like the ones used\n"
"to measure radiation exposure?"
msgstr ""
"胶片徽章？就是那种用来\n"
"测量辐射暴露的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x226012/0x000004
msgid "The radio man was wearing one."
msgstr "那无线电兵就戴着。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x496013/0x000000
msgid ""
"And whoever he was talking to\n"
"called the cargo \"spears.\""
msgstr ""
"跟他通话的人把货物\n"
"叫成\"矛\"。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x496013/0x000001
msgid "Wait, that would mean..."
msgstr "等等，那不就…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x496013/0x000002
msgid "Nukes."
msgstr "核弹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x496013/0x000003
msgid "They're bringing nukes into Costa Rica."
msgstr "他们要把核弹运进哥斯达黎加。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x496013/0x000004
msgid "Holy mother of God..."
msgstr "我的老天……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x72600f/0x000000
msgid "This is Snake. Kaz, can you hear me?"
msgstr "我是SNAKE。卡兹，听到吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x72600f/0x000001
msgid "Loud and clear. You found a radio?!"
msgstr "一清二楚。你找到无线电了？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x72600f/0x000002
msgid "It's got a circuit that reverses the audio phase."
msgstr "它有个能反转音频相位的电路。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x72600f/0x000003
msgid ""
"Let's switch frequencies from time to time...\n"
"Just to make sure we're not detected."
msgstr ""
"我们时不时换个频率吧……\n"
"确保不被发现。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5ad/0x72600f/0x000004
msgid "I found a map of their bases."
msgstr "我找到了他们基地的地图。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000000
msgid ""
"Have you seen a big transport boat, \n"
"mercenary crew, on the Río del Jade?"
msgstr ""
"你在翡翠河上见过一艘大型运输船吗，\n"
"上面是雇佣兵？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000001
msgid "You mean the barge? It's upstream from here."
msgstr "你说那艘驳船？就在这上游。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000002
msgid "Up toward Irazu."
msgstr "往伊拉苏方向。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000003
msgid "Any idea what's on it?"
msgstr "知道装了啥吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000004
msgid ""
"I could introduce you to\n"
"some of our compas up there. "
msgstr ""
"我可以把你介绍给\n"
"上面的一些弟兄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000005
msgid ""
"But I don't recommend going to \n"
"the mountains. We've lost a lot of people there."
msgstr ""
"但我不建议去\n"
"山里。我们在那里损失了很多人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000006
msgid ""
"They take us captive, torture us for \n"
"information about our compas... "
msgstr ""
"他们抓了我们的人，拷问\n"
"弟兄们的情报……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000007
msgid "and then they kill us like pigs."
msgstr "然后他们像杀猪一样杀了我们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000008
msgid ""
"...This was our last hideout.\n"
"The final refuge for el Frente"
msgstr ""
"...这是我们最后藏身处。\n"
"el Frente最后避难所"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x000009
msgid "after being pushed out of Nicaragua"
msgstr "在被赶出尼加拉瓜之后"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x00000a
msgid "and into this \"peaceful paradise\" of Costa Rica."
msgstr "逃进哥斯达黎加这个\"和平天堂\"。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x00000b
msgid "Then el monstruo attacked..."
msgstr "然后el monstruo袭击了..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x00000c
msgid "A Monster?"
msgstr "怪物？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x4260bb/0x00000d
msgid "Y mi viejo..."
msgstr "还有我的老家伙..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0000ae
msgid "I owe you one."
msgstr "我欠你一次。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000001
msgid "But, I prefer cigarettes, you know."
msgstr "不过，我更喜欢香烟，你知道的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000002
msgid "How do I look? A little like El Che, no?"
msgstr "我看起来怎么样？有点像El Che吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000003
msgid "You Cubano?"
msgstr "你是古巴人？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000004
msgid ""
"Colombiano. A photographer. I came to\n"
"Costa Rica to take pictures of birds."
msgstr ""
"哥伦比亚人。摄影师。我来\n"
"哥斯达黎加拍鸟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000005
msgid "Birds?"
msgstr "鸟？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000006
msgid "Yea umm... Quetzals."
msgstr "嗯...凤尾绿咬鹃。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000007
msgid ""
"You've got no telephoto lens.\n"
"How do you get your shots?"
msgstr ""
"你连长焦镜头都没有。\n"
"你怎么拍的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x726099/0x000008
msgid "Telephoto's for amateurs. It's all in the timing."
msgstr "长焦是给外行用的。全靠时机。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x7960fe/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x00002a
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000090
msgid "Get down!"
msgstr "趴下！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000000
msgid "Quien es?"
msgstr "Quien es？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000001
msgid "El Che?"
msgstr "El Che？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000002
msgid "No way."
msgstr "不可能。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000003
msgid "What do we do?"
msgstr "怎么办？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000004
msgid "Sandinistas, right?"
msgstr "桑地诺派，对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000005
msgid "I'm looking for someone."
msgstr "我在找一个人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000006
#: slot/0x003af96d/0x396f96/0x000050
msgid "Mi viejo..."
msgstr "我的老家伙..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000007
msgid "He's dead."
msgstr "他死了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000008
msgid "They killed nuestro viejo."
msgstr "他们杀了老首领。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x000009
msgid "You're his daughter?"
msgstr "你是他女儿？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x00000a
msgid ""
"Then that makes you \n"
"his delegada (representative), right?"
msgstr ""
"那你就是他的\n"
"delegada（代表），对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x00000b
msgid "Relax, I'm not your enemy."
msgstr "放松，我不是你的敌人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x00000c
msgid "Cuban?"
msgstr "古巴人？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x00000d
msgid "Hmph... A Cigar?"
msgstr "哼……来根雪茄？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0x926093/0x00000e
msgid "I'll take whatever you've got. "
msgstr "你有什么我都抽。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000000
msgid "Mi viejo, papá... He was la esperanza - our hope."
msgstr "我的老首领，爸爸……他曾是la esperanza——我们的希望。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000001
msgid ""
"Now that papá's gone, my sister is \n"
"la comandante de la revolucion."
msgstr ""
"爸爸走了，现在姐姐是\n"
"la comandante de la revolucion。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000002
msgid "Do not listen to him. "
msgstr "别听他的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000003
msgid ""
"Papá was a hero who fought by Sandino's side. \n"
"I am only his daughter."
msgstr ""
"爸爸是跟桑地诺并肩作战的英雄。\n"
"我只是他的女儿。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000004
msgid "You need a special talent to become cacique. "
msgstr "要成为cacique得有特殊才能。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000005
msgid "It takes someone great to unite all of las compas."
msgstr "得是了不起人才能团结所有las compas。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000006
msgid ""
"Sorry to interrupt, but leaders don't choose \n"
"themselves. Neither do heroes."
msgstr ""
"抱歉打断，但领袖不是自封的。\n"
"英雄也不是。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000007
msgid ""
"You carry on his legacy of la esperanza, \n"
"and they'll follow you. No question."
msgstr ""
"你继承他的la esperanza遗志，\n"
"他们就会追随你。毫无疑问。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000008
msgid ""
"You think so? My compas trust me, \n"
"but not one of them calls me comandante."
msgstr ""
"你这么想？我的compas信任我，\n"
"但没一个叫我comandante。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x000009
#: slot/0x003af62d/0xa2620f/0x000000
#: slot/0x003af90d/0x905660/0x000000
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005d
msgid "Amanda!"
msgstr "阿曼达！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x00000a
msgid "See what I mean?"
msgstr "明白我的意思了吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xa260d7/0x00000b
msgid "El colibri!"
msgstr "El colibri！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000000
msgid "Let me smoke too!"
msgstr "也让我抽一口！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000001
msgid "We can talk until I finish this."
msgstr "抽完这根前聊聊。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000002
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x326173/0x000002
msgid "Chico!"
msgstr "奇科！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000003
msgid "Tell me what's going on here."
msgstr "告诉我这怎么回事。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000004
msgid ""
"This place is crawling with soldiers.\n"
"They don't look like private security. "
msgstr ""
"这地方到处都是士兵。\n"
"他们不像私人安保。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000005
msgid ""
"More like hired guns. They're loaded with\n"
"the latest gear from all over the world."
msgstr ""
"更像雇佣兵。他们装备着\n"
"世界各地最先进的武器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000006
msgid ""
"I heard they're a security force\n"
"hired by CODESA."
msgstr ""
"听说他们是由CODESA\n"
"雇佣的安保部队。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000007
msgid ""
"Yeah, and I'm Papá Noel.\n"
"Those guys are UCLAs."
msgstr ""
"是啊，我还是圣诞老人呢。\n"
"那些家伙是UCLA。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000008
msgid ""
"UCLAs (Unilaterally Controlled Latino Assets)\n"
"... la CIA?"
msgstr ""
"UCLA（单方面控制的拉美资产）\n"
"……CIA？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000009
msgid "I saw them setting up shop in town. "
msgstr "我看见他们在镇上扎营。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000a
msgid ""
"They're planning to do here\n"
"what they did in Chile."
msgstr ""
"他们打算在这里\n"
"重演智利的勾当。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000b
msgid "If that's the case, what are they after?"
msgstr "若真如此，他们图什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000c
msgid "Whatever it is, it's not us..."
msgstr "不管图什么，反正不是我们……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000d
msgid ""
"You don't think they're here to \n"
"push you back into Nicaragua?"
msgstr ""
"你觉得他们不是来\n"
"把你赶回尼加拉瓜的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000e
msgid "Impossible. Too much hardware - too many bases."
msgstr "不可能。装备太多，基地太多。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x00000f
msgid ""
"Didn’t you see? They've got helicopters,\n"
"tanks... It's like we're in Da Nang."
msgstr ""
"你没看见吗？他们有直升机、\n"
"坦克……简直像在岘港。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000010
msgid " There must be something else."
msgstr "肯定另有目的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000011
msgid "They have a base near here?"
msgstr "他们附近有基地？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000012
msgid ""
"There's a factory to the north, \n"
"across a suspension bridge."
msgstr ""
"北边有座工厂，\n"
"过一座吊桥就是。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af5cd/0xb260b3/0x000013
msgid "Factory to the north, across a bridge."
msgstr "北边工厂，过桥即到。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x326173/0x000000
msgid "What the hell?!"
msgstr "搞什么？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x326173/0x000001
msgid ""
"Es un hombre nuevo. An unmanned weapon.\n"
"A robot!"
msgstr ""
"Es un hombre nuevo。无人兵器。\n"
"机器人！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x726176/0x000000
msgid "No! He won't survive the fall!"
msgstr "不！他摔下去会死的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x726176/0x000001
msgid "Out of my way!"
msgstr "让开！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0x726176/0x000002
msgid ""
"Better for him to die at the hand of \n"
"a compa than suffer their torture."
msgstr ""
"与其受他们折磨，\n"
"不如死在同志手里。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0xa96192/0x000000
msgid ""
"Stay here. As long as I'm still alive, \n"
"I might as well repay you."
msgstr ""
"待在这。只要我还活着，\n"
"就该报答你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0xa96192/0x000001
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x00001b
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000081
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x814381/0x000000
msgid "Over here!"
msgstr "这边！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af60d/0xa96192/0x000002
msgid "Find Chico! ¡Venceremos!"
msgstr "找到奇科！¡Venceremos！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af62d/0x3261f1/0x000000
msgid "Intruder detected. Intruder detected."
msgstr "发现入侵者。发现入侵者。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af62d/0x3261f1/0x000001
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0001f7
msgid "Commencing attack."
msgstr "开始攻击。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af62d/0x326213/0x000000
msgid "Shoot it!"
msgstr "开枪打它！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af62d/0x326213/0x000001
msgid "You'll fall!"
msgstr "你会掉下去的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af62d/0x326213/0x000002
msgid "Shoot el Chicolibri!"
msgstr "射杀蜂鸟！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af90d/0x901a62/0x000000
#: slot/0x003af90d/0x901e5e/0x000000
msgid ""
"I will take my own life before I sell out \n"
"my compas under torture!"
msgstr ""
"我宁死也不会在酷刑下\n"
"出卖同伴！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af90d/0x902662/0x000000
msgid "What are you aiming at? El chicolibri!"
msgstr "你在瞄什么？蜂鸟！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000001
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000007
msgid "Chico..."
msgstr "奇科……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000002
msgid "What? What is it?"
msgstr "什么？怎么了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000003
msgid "Can you... roll me one?"
msgstr "你能……给我卷一根吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000004
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "嗯？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000005
msgid "Tobacco..."
msgstr "烟草…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000006
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000010
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000006
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x000002
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327162/0x00000e
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00005d
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "嗯。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000008
msgid "Hold still."
msgstr "别动。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x000009
msgid "I treated him like a kid again... we fought."
msgstr "我又把他当小孩，我们吵了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x00000a
#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000071
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr "嗯？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326df7/0x00000b
msgid "I didn't want Chico to know... Kept it a secret."
msgstr "我不想让奇科知道……一直瞒着他。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000000
msgid "Kaz, can you hear me?"
msgstr "卡兹，能听到吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000001
msgid "MSF here."
msgstr "MSF收到。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000002
msgid "One for recovery. She's wounded."
msgstr "一人回收。她受伤了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000003
msgid "Acknowledged."
msgstr "收到。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000004
msgid ""
"Kaz, the cargo on the barge... I was right, \n"
"it's headed for the mountains."
msgstr ""
"卡兹，驳船上的货物……我猜对了，\n"
"正运往山里。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000005
msgid "You think that's where they're taking the nukes?"
msgstr "你觉得核弹被送到那里了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x326e59/0x000006
msgid "I'm sure of it. Let's move."
msgstr "我确定。行动吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000000
msgid "A front. It's a drug refining plant."
msgstr "是个幌子。其实是毒品提炼厂。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000001
msgid "The KGB set it up for us to run."
msgstr "克格勃建起来让我们经营的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000002
msgid "We use the income to buy food and weapons..."
msgstr "我们用收入买粮食和武器……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000003
msgid "Mi viejo never said a word, but we all knew."
msgstr "我爸从没提过，但我们都心知肚明。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000004
msgid "Ooh... everyone except Chico."
msgstr "唔……除了奇科，所有人都在。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000005
msgid "Everything we have... Our weapons, our compas..."
msgstr "我们的一切……武器、战友……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000006
msgid "He brought it all together..."
msgstr "是他把大家聚到一起……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000007
msgid "We were going to rebuild our country..."
msgstr "我们本想重建祖国……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000008
msgid "rebuild Nica with our own hands..."
msgstr "亲手重建尼加拉瓜……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000009
msgid "even if we had to dirty our hands to do it... "
msgstr "哪怕双手沾满污秽……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000a
msgid "But it's all over. We lost our cacique. Papá..."
msgstr "但一切都完了。我们失去了首领。爸爸……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000b
msgid "I could never replace him..."
msgstr "我无法取代他……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000c
msgid ""
"Now they've taken the plant from us, too... \n"
"There's no place left to regroup..."
msgstr ""
"现在他们连工厂也夺走了……\n"
"再没有地方可以重整旗鼓……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000d
msgid "No way to fight la revolución..."
msgstr "没法继续革命了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000e
msgid "Here... I rolled you one."
msgstr "给……我给你卷了一根。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x00000f
msgid "What about you? You're going after that cargo?"
msgstr "你呢？你要去追那批货？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000011
msgid "Must be important, mmm?"
msgstr "一定很重要吧，嗯？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000012
msgid "Looks that way."
msgstr "看来是。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e17/0x000013
msgid "It... Looks like it could be nukes..."
msgstr "那……像是核弹……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000000
msgid ""
"There's a prison up in the mountains... \n"
"That's probably where he is."
msgstr ""
"山里有个监狱……\n"
"他大概就在那里。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000001
msgid "A prison in the mountains..."
msgstr "山里的监狱……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000002
msgid ""
"You must do something for me.\n"
"If you... can't save Chico..."
msgstr ""
"你得帮我做件事。\n"
"如果你……救不了奇科……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000003
msgid ""
"I want you to... ease his pain... \n"
"End his humiliation..."
msgstr ""
"我要你……减轻他的痛苦……\n"
"结束他的屈辱……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000004
msgid ""
"If he gives in, if he's about to sell out \n"
"his compas... Please..."
msgstr ""
"如果他屈服，如果他要出卖\n"
"战友……求你……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000005
msgid "...At least let him keep his honor."
msgstr "……至少让他保住尊严。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000006
msgid "That's a promise I can't make."
msgstr "这个承诺我做不到。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x426e38/0x000007
msgid "...Why?"
msgstr "……为什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000000
msgid ""
"Amanda, we gave up our homes. \n"
"But we're still alive."
msgstr ""
"阿曼达，我们没了家园。\n"
"但还活着。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000001
msgid "We're still fighting."
msgstr "我们还在战斗。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000002
msgid ""
"And there's always another reason \n"
"to keep on living."
msgstr ""
"而且总有另一个理由\n"
"让人活下去。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000003
msgid "Ahh, I feel alive again..."
msgstr "啊，我又感觉活过来了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000004
msgid "Amanda, join my unit until you've healed up."
msgstr "阿曼达，伤好前加入我部队吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000005
msgid "Your... unit?"
msgstr "你的……部队？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000007
msgid "Who are you? Why are you here?"
msgstr "你是谁？为何在这？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000008
msgid "...I'm Snake. Serpiente."
msgstr "……我是SNAKE。Serpiente。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x000009
msgid "\"Snake?\""
msgstr "“SNAKE？”"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x00000a
msgid "Could it be..."
msgstr "难道……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x00000b
msgid "the great cacique..."
msgstr "伟大的酋长……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x00000c
msgid "has come to lead us..."
msgstr "来带领我们……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x826e53/0x00000d
msgid "patria libre o morir... "
msgstr "自由祖国或死亡……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000000
msgid "Wha-? Nukes?!"
msgstr "什么——？核弹？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000001
msgid ""
"¡Madre de dios! No time to waste!\n"
"We must get to Irazú!"
msgstr ""
"圣母啊！没时间了！\n"
"必须去伊拉苏！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000002
msgid "The transport route leads there."
msgstr "运输路线通向那里。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000003
msgid ""
"It must be where they're holding Chico\n"
"and my compas, too..."
msgstr ""
"他们一定把奇科\n"
"和我的同志们关在那里……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000004
msgid ""
"Whenever Chico and I argue, \n"
"he goes off to be by himself..."
msgstr ""
"每次奇科和我吵架，\n"
"他都一个人跑出去……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000005
msgid ""
"That's why he knows more than \n"
"anybody about their bases."
msgstr ""
"所以他比谁都清楚\n"
"他们的基地。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000006
msgid "He... Oh, Chico..."
msgstr "他……哦，奇科……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000007
msgid "You're pretty worried about your baby brother."
msgstr "你很担心你的小弟弟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000008
msgid "This is why I'm not fit to be a leader..."
msgstr "这就是我不配当领袖……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x000009
msgid "Fine. It's a little bit out of my way, but..."
msgstr "好吧。虽然有点绕路，但是……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0x926e32/0x00000a
msgid "Just tell me where I need to go."
msgstr "只要告诉我该去哪儿就行。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000000
msgid "Somoza's guardia chased us out of Nicaragua,"
msgstr "索摩查的国民卫队把我们赶出尼加拉瓜，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003af92d/0xb26e10/0x000001
msgid "across the Rio San Juan... and we ended up here."
msgstr "越过圣胡安河……最后到了这里。"
